message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Ulam OPDP Difficulty Atlas"
type: dataset
version: "1.6.0-opdp-1.0-append-only"
date-released: 2026-08-26
authors:
  - family-names: "Zarzuelo Urdiales"
    given-names: "Alejandro"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alejandrozu/ulam-opdp-difficulty-atlas"
url: "https://github.com/alejandrozu/ulam-opdp-difficulty-atlas"
abstract: >-
  Auditable Open Problem Difficulty Profiles for 15,458 problems, preserving
  all 8,785 records from the append-only v1.5 release and appending 6,673
  Oberwolfach Reports Open Problems records from UnsolvedMath v1.6.0. The
  three frozen cohorts contain 5,426 original records, 3,359 AIM Workshop
  Problem Lists records, and 6,673 Oberwolfach records drawn from 1,106
  distinct reports. Prepared by Alejandro Zarzuelo Urdiales with ChatGPT 5.6
  Sol.
keywords:
  - open problems
  - mathematics
  - artificial intelligence
  - difficulty assessment
  - UnsolvedMath
  - OPDP
  - Oberwolfach Reports
  - source-aware analysis
